<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 71-1 AT TEA, CHASING 305 TO WIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 71-1 AT TEA, CHASING 305 TO WIN.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 71 for the loss of one wicket in their second innings at tea on the fourth day of their third and final cricket test against New Zealand on Monday.</p>
<p>Chasing 305 to win, England require a further 234 with nine wickets in hand.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 346, second innings 186.</p>
<p>England first innings 228, second innings 71 for one (M. Atherton 35 not out).</p>
</text>
